      "v": 6,
      "zh": "你 的 同 胞 弟 兄 ， 或 是 你 的 兒 女 ， 或 是 你 懷 中 的 妻 ， 或 是 如 同 你 性 命 的 朋 友 ， 若 暗 中 引 誘 你 ， 說 ： 我 們 不 如 去 事 奉 你 和 你 列 祖 素 來 所 不 認 識 的 別 神 ─",
      "en": "Suppose your own full brother,[NOTE:1] your son, your daughter, your beloved wife, or your closest friend should seduce you secretly and encourage you to go and serve other gods[NOTE:2] that neither you nor your ancestors[NOTE:3] have previously known,[NOTE:4]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “your brother, the son of your mother.” In a polygamous society it was not rare to have half brothers and sisters by way of a common father and different mothers.",
